  "description": "“Please come with me and save the world.”\n\nWhile enjoying a holiday, chef Yoo-jung’s peaceful life is suddenly interrupted by a mysterious man.\n\nIntroducing himself as an otherworldly being, ‘Nemo’ asks Yoo-jung to cross over to the world beyond the shoe cabinet and help him save it.\n\nNo matter how many times Yoo-jung refuses, this man… is unbelievably persistent. And to make things worse—has he really survived his whole life eating nothing but stones?\n\nFeeling sorry for him, Yoo-jung prepares various dishes, feeding and taking care of him for days—until one day, Nemo suddenly disappears.\n\nBefore long, Yoo-jung steps through the passage to the other world.\n\nWill Yoo-jung be able to find Nemo again?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
